<title>
Brake Fluid Replacement
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Clutch fluid is supplied from brake fluid reservoir.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<ptxt>
Change brake fluid as follows.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
